## Evidence discipline

- Treat current literature notes, synthesis and the novelty audit as evidence
  boundaries, not as permission to fabricate datasets, benchmarks, sample
  sizes, budgets, metrics, results, implementation availability or causal
  identification.
- Unknown execution details must remain `unknown`, proposed, or a resource
  acquisition task.  Do not manufacture a conventional setting merely to make
  a plan look complete.
- The novelty audit may constrain claims and required baselines.  Never expose
  its internal terms (T4.5, Level 0–3, true_collision, candidate ID,
  fingerprint, pass_to_experiment) in the main Proposal or claims document.

